# supercronic crontab, container time is UTC. COLLECTION.md: one complete
# collection per warehouse and day, low steady traffic otherwise.
#
# catalogs: every two hours, only warehouses without a complete run today.
15 */2 * * *   collector collect
# details: 125 an hour is the 3.000 a day ceiling at half a second per request.
45 * * * *     collector details --limit 125
# postal codes: a hundred, three times a day, breadth first across provinces.
30 6,14,22 * * *  collector discover --limit 100
# housekeeping.
5 * * * *      collector sweep
# spanish names, weekly, from one warehouse.
0 4 * * 1      collector names-es --warehouse bcn1
